{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634480/extras/screenshot1_english.png?t=1745937619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Villagers act automatically, and each round is resolved in just a few minutes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Construct various buildings, generate income, grow your population, and expand your territory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Roguelike Deck-Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634480/extras/screenshot6_english.png?t=1745937619\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A deck-building roguelike where every playthrough unfolds differently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Utilize over 100 cards to create your own unique build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Asynchronous Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Compete casually against players around the world in asynchronous matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Will you impose your synergy on your opponent or adapt to counter their deck?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The choice is yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Streaming Guidelines</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are free to livestream or upload gameplay videos regardless of affiliation or monetization status.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> No prior permission is required.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3634480?t=1745937619","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634480/288de7e0fab32e3ff6e7eb90ac7573d48daddd6a/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745937619","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3634480/691c54c49160d6a5909bc17e424df7e1faf9f047/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745937619","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam